<view wx:if="{{isMock}}" class="demo">内测演示 · 数据仅保存在本机</view>
<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在获取活动规则…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}<button class="text-button" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{activity}}">
    <view class="eyebrow">ORIGINAL RALLY / {{activity.difficulty}}</view>
    <view class="title">{{activity.title}}</view>
    <view class="hero"><view class="hero-content"><view class="tag tag-dark">{{activity.stateText}}</view><view class="hero-title">{{activity.difficulty}}同行</view><view class="hero-bottom">{{activity.dateText}}<text>{{'\n'}}</text>{{activity.location}}</view></view></view>
    <view class="row small"><text>计划结束</text><text class="muted">{{activity.endText}}</text></view>
    <view class="row small mt"><text>申请截止</text><text class="muted">{{activity.deadlineText}}</text></view>
    <view class="row small mt"><text>活动名额</text><text class="muted">{{activity.capacity}} 位 · 余 {{activity.slots}} 位</text></view>
    <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">活动介绍</text><text class="section-index">01 / RIDE</text></view>
    <view class="paragraph small">{{activity.description}}</view>
    <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">参与要求</text><text class="section-index">02 / READY</text></view>
    <view class="card">
      <view class="row"><text>成长积分门槛</text><text>{{activity.minGrowthPoints}} 分</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{gap > 0}}" class="notice">{{member ? '当前成长分还差 ' + gap + ' 分。' : '可先建立身份，核对成长记录。'}}先从适合自己的入门同行开始。</view>
      <view wx:else class="small muted mt">积分达到门槛，仍需核对技能、车况与现场安全条件。</view>
      <view class="divider"></view>
      <view class="small">必要资格：{{activity.requiredQualifications.length ? '' : '本场无额外资格要求'}}</view>
      <view wx:for="{{activity.requiredQualifications}}" wx:key="*this" class="tag mt">{{item}}</view>
      <view class="small muted mt">{{activity.requiresReview ? '本场需要工作人员审核资格。' : '提交后由工作人员线下联系、确认安排。'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="field-label">必要装备</view><view class="paragraph small mb">{{activity.equipment}}</view>
    <view class="field-label">风险与安全说明</view><view class="paragraph small">{{activity.safetyNotice}}</view>
    <view class="notice">参与非铺装摩托车活动存在风险，请依据个人能力与车况决定。积分不替代技能和现场安全判断。食宿交通由参加者自理，线下服务安排及必要费用由组织者另行真实告知。</view>
    <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">完成奖励</text><text class="section-index">03 / GROW</text></view>
    <view class="stats"><view class="stat"><view class="stat-number">+{{activity.pointsRule.growth}}</view><view class="stat-label">成长积分</view></view><view class="stat"><view class="stat-number">+{{activity.pointsRule.annual}}</view><view class="stat-label">年度积分</view></view><view class="stat"><view class="stat-number">+1</view><view class="stat-label">完成次数</view></view></view>
    <view class="small muted paragraph">仅完整出发核验、结束核验并经结算后记录。候补、报名、签到、未到和安全退出不直接发完成奖励。当前规则版本 v{{activity.ruleVersion}}。</view>
    <view class="notice">名额已满可提交候补，按申请顺序与资格复核提升。申请不代表确认参加；确认参加表示资格与线下安排已确认。</view>
    <view class="bottom-bar">
      <button wx:if="{{registration}}" class="primary full" bindtap="mine">{{registration.stateText}} · 查看我的活动</button>
      <button wx:elif="{{activity.canApply}}" class="primary full" disabled="{{member && gap > 0}}" bindtap="apply">{{activity.slots > 0 ? '提交报名意向' : '提交候补意向'}}</button>
      <button wx:else class="secondary full" disabled>当前{{activity.stateText}}</button>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
